# PLI-ASTRA-V1 — basket-ordered weighed development card

Date: 2026-09-05. FUTURE WORK ONLY / NOT COMPOUNDED / NOT RELEASED.
Master: 6.000 g. This is NOT a 6 mL pipette recipe. The separate diagnostic µL table is not executable.
Source: formulas/Prada_LHomme_Intense_Astra_V1_30mL_EDP.md.
All material masses include their declared carriers. Do not add the listed carrier totals a second time.

## Before weighing

- The 20% w/w Coumarin in DEP and 10% w/w Heliotropal in DEP rows require the NEW labeled preparations in the formula. They are not yet prepared. Do not substitute the ambiguous old Coumarin stock.
- Use the owned 9% w/w Orris Liquid product in DEP; 9% does not mean irones. Use the exact 25% w/w mixed-carrier Ambrox Super, not Ambrofix.
- Reconcile every physical bottle/lot, remaining quantity and clear/homogeneous condition. Master arithmetic does not certify handling or skin safety.
- Validate balance uncertainty at the smallest transfer: 40 mg here, requiring <=0.4 mg uncertainty for a 1% criterion. A display digit is not validation. If necessary multiply EVERY mass by a common factor.
- Basket numbers follow the user's list. Suederal's placement with woods is provisional because its exact physical basket is not recorded. Move the complete row, never its dose.

